unit-test modul-yang-mendefinisikan-model-punya-tests|tests-dir-hilang -- the actual scenario tests for these fixture models live in the provider module's own tests/ directory (ssi_donation/tests/test_donation_fund_usage.py), matching the established SSI convention for testing an AbstractModel mixin (e.g. ssi_related_attachment_mixin/tests/test_mixin_related_attachment.py tests test.related_attachment from test_ssi_related_attachment_mixin). A duplicate tests/ dir here would be redundant and never executed.
